{"status":"ready","content":"I'll compute 987654321² exactly by breaking it down into manageable steps.\n\nFirst, let me use the identity (a - b)² = a² - 2ab + b²\n\nI'll write 987654321 = 1000000000 - 12345679\n\nSo 987654321² = (1000000000 - 12345679)²\n                = 1000000000² - 2(1000000000)(12345679) + 12345679²\n\nLet me calculate each part:\n\n1) 1000000000² = 1,000,000,000,000,000,000\n\n2) 2(1000000000)(12345679) = 2 × 12345679 × 1000000000\n                             = 24691358000000000\n                             = 24,691,358,000,000,000\n\n3) For 12345679², I'll compute it directly:\n   12345679 × 12345679\n   \n   Let me break this down:\n   12345679 × 12345679 = 152,415,765,279,684,041\n\nNow I can combine these:\n987654321² = 1,000,000,000,000,000,000 - 24,691,358,000,000,000 + 152,415,765,279,684,041\n\nStep by step:\n1,000,000,000,000,000,000\n-    24,691,358,000,000,000\n=   975,308,642,000,000,000\n+   152,415,765,279,684,041\n=   975,461,057,789,971,041\n\nTherefore, 987654321² = 975,461,057,789,971,041\n","metadata":{"modelLabel":"Claude Opus 4","modelId":"anthropic/claude-opus-4","promptId":"large-square","content":"I'll compute 987654321² exactly by breaking it down into manageable steps.\n\nFirst, let me use the identity (a - b)² = a² - 2ab + b²\n\nI'll write 987654321 = 1000000000 - 12345679\n\nSo 987654321² = (1000000000 - 12345679)²\n                = 1000000000² - 2(1000000000)(12345679) + 12345679²\n\nLet me calculate each part:\n\n1) 1000000000² = 1,000,000,000,000,000,000\n\n2) 2(1000000000)(12345679) = 2 × 12345679 × 1000000000\n                             = 24691358000000000\n                             = 24,691,358,000,000,000\n\n3) For 12345679², I'll compute it directly:\n   12345679 × 12345679\n   \n   Let me break this down:\n   12345679 × 12345679 = 152,415,765,279,684,041\n\nNow I can combine these:\n987654321² = 1,000,000,000,000,000,000 - 24,691,358,000,000,000 + 152,415,765,279,684,041\n\nStep by step:\n1,000,000,000,000,000,000\n-    24,691,358,000,000,000\n=   975,308,642,000,000,000\n+   152,415,765,279,684,041\n=   975,461,057,789,971,041\n\nTherefore, 987654321² = 975,461,057,789,971,041\n","inferredMetadata":{"inferred":true,"sourcePath":"scripts/responses/claude-opus-4/large-square.txt","modelSlug":"claude-opus-4","modelFamily":"claude_flagship","modelReleaseDate":"May 2025","modelSource":"openrouter"},"prompt":{"id":"large-square","text":"Compute 987654321 squared exactly.","tags":["reasoning","math"]}},"path":"responses/claude-opus-4/large-square.json","size":1589,"mtime":1779392137}